// A co-op mission is Story co-op (mode 'coop'), Skirmish co-op (mode 'skirmish' deployed while connected) or an Ambush run
// deployed while connected. Nothing but the DISCONNECT button and a lost connection ends the session: not the end of a
// mission, not L, not a mode tab.
const LINKABLE=['coop','skirmish','ambush'];
// Down and revive, in every co-op mode. A player whose health runs out is down, not dead: for REVIVE.wait seconds the
// teammate can bring them back by holding the interact key within REVIVE.range of them for REVIVE.time, unable to fire,
// stab or throw meanwhile. The wait does not run while the revive does. Revived, the player stands up where they fell
// with REVIVE.health. Not revived in time, the player is dead: in Ambush they watch the teammate to the end of the run, in
// Story and Skirmish the operation fails, as any death did. Both down at once ends the mission in every mode. The host
// keeps the clocks; a guest's revive is counted from when the guest began it (sinceSent), as its reload is.
